    "The Vault of Shadows": {tip:"Complete four puzzles to reach a vault hidden in the shadow realm at Kharid-et, each started from a wall dial activated with a spell scroll.",loc:"Kharid-et Dig Site",req:"107 Archaeology (boostable), Time Served completed, all shadow anchors powered or pylon active (also available as a quest version requiring 58 Archaeology and 60 Divination)",items:["Legatus pendant (may be stored in the tool belt)", "Pontifex signet ring (may be stored in the tool belt)", "'Incite Fear' spell scroll", "'Exsanguinate' spell scroll", "'Smoke Cloud' spell scroll", "'Animate Dead' spell scroll"],rewards:["2500 Archaeology experience (ice button puzzle, 58 Archaeology)", "5000 Archaeology experience (blood button puzzle, 86 Archaeology)", "7500 Archaeology experience (smoke button puzzle, 100 Archaeology)", "10000 Archaeology experience (shadow button puzzle, 107 Archaeology)", "25000 Divination experience", "30000 Archaeology experience", "Ability to teleport between the five buttons"],steps:["Obtain the four spell scrolls used to activate the inactive dials around the site: 'Incite Fear' spell scroll (excavated from the carcerem debris, restored with 58 Archaeology), 'Exsanguinate' spell scroll (Orcus altar, 86), 'Smoke Cloud' spell scroll (culinarum debris, 100), 'Animate Dead' spell scroll (ancient magick munitions, 107). If you lack the level, a loaned version of a scroll may be received from Dr Nabanik; a restored scroll must later be given to him to receive the experience reward.", "Ice button: enter the prison block of Kharid-et and go through the eastern door (requires Time Served). The inactive dial is on the middle of the western wall, south of the corridor. Cast 'Incite Fear' while standing next to the dial, then press the ice button to teleport to the first puzzle room.", "First puzzle room: pick up praetor's log page 1; the vault code is shadow dials first (top row), then blood, then smoke, then ice (bottom row). Position the camera facing north with the vault door on the right, then move: North-East dial forward once, East forward once, North-East back once, South-West back once, South forward twice, South-East forward twice, Centre forward once, North back once, South back once, West forward once, North-West forward once. The door opens; take praetor's log page 2 and leave via the button you entered from.", "Blood button: pass the pontifex barrier to enter the chapel at the south-east of the main fortress. The inactive dial is on the northern wall. Cast 'Exsanguinate' next to the dial, then press the blood button to teleport to the second puzzle room.", "Second puzzle room (five controls in an X formation; face the door): move South-West back once, Centre forward once, North-West forward twice, South-West back once, Centre back twice, North-East forward once, South-East forward once, Centre back once, North-East back twice, Centre back twice, North-East back once, Centre back once, South-West back once, South-East forward once, Centre forward once, South-East forward once, Centre forward once, South-East forward once, South-West forward once, Centre forward once, South-West back once, Centre forward twice. Praetor's log page 3 appears in your backpack; leave the vault.", "Smoke button: go to the culinarum excavation site in the north-east part of the main fortress. The inactive dial is on the western wall next to the oven. Cast 'Smoke Cloud' next to the dial, then press the smoke button to teleport to the third puzzle room.", "Third puzzle room (buttons in a horizontal line facing the door; B means move the dial back): press 5B, 2, 7B, 3, 3, 4B (top row complete); 2, 7B, 2B; 1, 1, 8B, 1B, 1B; 3, 3, 8, 3, 3 (second row complete); 7B, 4, 8, 4B (puzzle complete). Praetor's log page 4 is placed in your backpack; leave the vault.", "Shadow button: power all eight shadow anchors (80 pylon batteries total, 10 per anchor; repeating the Zarosian I collection for Soran in Varrock gives 20 batteries each time) or wait until the Kharid-et pylon is active, then enter the praetorium via the praetorium war table. The inactive dial is in the small room furthest west, on the western wall. Cast 'Animate Dead' next to the dial, then press the shadow button to teleport to the final puzzle room.", "Final puzzle room: press 3 forward twice, 1 back once, 3 back twice, 1 back once, 5 back once, 2 forward twice, 4 forward once, 1 back once, 3 back once, 1 forward once, 5 back once, 3 forward twice, 5 forward once, 2 back once, 3 back once, 2 back once, 3 forward twice, 4 forward twice, 3 forward twice.", "After completing all four puzzles, pick up the shadow engrammeter (depleted) from the centre of the vault.", "Charge the shadow engrammeter by collecting the equivalent of 500 vibrant or higher tier Divination memories (enriched memories count double; divine energies cannot be used).", "Return to the centre of the vault and operate the charged shadow engrammeter to get Trindine's memory.", "Bring the memory to Dr Nabanik outside the main fortress of Kharid-et Dig Site to get Trindine's memory as a book.", "Bring the book back to the vault and talk to Praetor Trindine in the centre. Azzanadra will appear and ask you to leave so the two may speak privately; the mystery is completed at this point."],pages:[[18, "Praetor's log page 1"], [19, "Praetor's log page 2"], [20, "Praetor's log page 3"], [21, "Praetor's log page 4"]]},
    "Queen of the Icyene": {tip:"Locate the lost pages of Queen Efaritay's journal at the Everlight Dig Site.",loc:"Everlight Dig Site",req:"42 Archaeology (boostable)",items:["Queen's journal page 1", "Queen's journal page 2", "Queen's journal page 3", "Queen's journal page 4"],rewards:["2100 Archaeology experience"],steps:["Find one of the four Queen's journal pages from the prodromoi remains or the monoceros remains excavation hotspots at the Everlight Dig Site.", "Collect the other three Queen's journal pages from the prodromoi remains or the monoceros remains excavation hotspots at the Everlight Dig Site.", "Once all four pages are found, speak with Vanescula again. If asked if you want to speak about Fallen Angels or more, choose more, and the mystery will automatically complete."],pages:[[22, "Queen's journal page 1"], [23, "Queen's journal page 2"], [24, "Queen's journal page 3"], [25, "Queen's journal page 4"]],auto:[[0, 1], [1, 4]]},
