    "Know Thy Measure": {tip:"Solve the dragonkin pylon and statue symbol codes at Orthen to open the Moksha ritual site.",loc:"Orthen Dig Site",req:"90 Archaeology, Qualification - Associate, talked to Mr Mordaut about the dig site",items:[],rewards:["39,500 Archaeology XP", "Access to the Moksha ritual site"],steps:["Head to the Observation outpost and enter the door on the north side.", "The dragonkin pylon is just inside the door. Interact until it displays symbols.", "Cycle each symbol to change it until they show: 3, 1, 5 (Hep). When done successfully it will say 'You hear a small beeping noise.'", "Cycle symbols to: 4, 1, 4 (Kal). When done successfully, it will say 'You hear a small beeping noise.'", "Cycle symbols to: 1, 6, 7 (Ort). When done successfully, the symbols will disappear.", "Continue dialogue.", "Inspect the strange device which appears in your backpack, and choose the option to peer into it.", "Proceed to the entrance to the Moksha ritual site.", "Interact with the dragonkin statue to enter the pass phrase: Sha, Cra, Lith, Kab.", "Cycle the symbols to: 5, 1, 6 (Nos). If done successfully, it will say 'You hear a small beeping noise.'", "Cycle the symbols to: 4, 1, 8 (Kay). If done successfully, it will say 'You hear a small beeping noise.'", "Cycle the symbols to: 5, 1, 4 (Mok). If done successfully, the symbols will disappear and a door will open.", "Enter the stairs down to solve the mystery.", "Optionally, activate the teleportation device inside."]},
